    "show_share": true,
    "description": "For Jane Njeri Mugo, the completion of her Master of Science in Advanced Practice Nursing (MSc APN) from Aga Khan University's School of Nursing and Midwifery, East Africa (SONAM EA) is more than just an academic milestone. It is the culmination of a journey shaped by dedication, hard work, and a deep connection with an institution that has influenced both her personal and professional life.",
